{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 8, :comments ["<b>See, I have given.</b> You see with your own eyes — I do not tell you from estimate or hearsay (Sifrei)." "<b>Come and possess.</b> No one contests the matter, and you do not need war — had they not sent spies they would not have needed weapons (see there)." "<b>To your fathers.</b> Why did He mention again Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob? Rather — Abraham is worthy on his own, Isaac is worthy on his own, Jacob is worthy on his own (there)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:45:20.125183884Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}